=== parameters ===
liquidation: X0=1e6 shares over T=1 day, N=10 slices; σ daily=0.02; temp impact η; perm γ
cite: Almgren & Chriss 2000/2001 Journal of Risk 3(2) pp.5–39 — Optimal execution of portfolio transactions
cite: Perold 1988 JPM 14(3) — The implementation shortfall: paper vs reality
cite: TWAP/VWAP as schedule benchmarks (industry TCA); arrival-price IS decomposition
look-ahead: schedules use only ex-ante volume/price forecasts; post-trade report uses realized path

